  lines:
  - lineId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded_FieldUnit_001
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Inspector, companion-request volume is high across Building A's public
      level. The children's area, work pods, and park-side assistance points are
      all connected to the synchronized network.
    holdSeconds: 10.96132
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 08da66330cd2b0147a078aa015ab30f6, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded_Mia_001
    presentationKind: 2
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 2
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Mia
    text: I can see that.
    holdSeconds: 2.6594338
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49296362edda11141b57aab165aca0bb, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded_FieldUnit_002
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: This community averages one public companion unit for every four residents,
      above the residential norm.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e8b681be0cebd9c48b136e1527c8f8ad, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - lineId: Lobby_AssignmentLoaded_FieldUnit_003
    presentationKind: 0
    dialogueMode: 0
    speakerSide: 0
    advancePolicy: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That reduces gaps in care and helps residents handle emotional support,
      daily companionship, and childhood learning more quickly.
    holdSeconds: 7.9424524
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1c17a6ffeda07e946b40ffc82c8dc889, type: 3}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
